Julia Lawall wrote:
> 
> From: Julia Lawall <julia@diku.dk>
> 
> Use kzalloc rather than kcalloc(1,...)
> 
> The semantic patch that makes this change is as follows:
> (http://coccinelle.lip6.fr/)
> 
> // <smpl>
> @@
> @@
> 
> - kcalloc(1,
> + kzalloc(
>           ...)
> // </smpl>
> 
> Signed-off-by: Julia Lawall <julia@diku.dk>

Applied now.  Thanks.


Takashi

